      "comment": "BUN VICKY (6) hit the ground running last start and was never headed (24.30) at this track in Maiden over 425m. Can measure up again. CHAPPY'S HIKARI (4) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage second, beaten a long neck (22.62) at Ballarat in a T3 Grade 6 over 390m. Hard to beat again. SAINT FRANKLIN (8) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at his last four runs. Last time finished 3rd on August 22 over 390m at Ballarat behind Carnival Kid beaten 2.5 lengths (22.82) in a T3 Grade 7. Expected to feature. MACK IN BOOTS (3) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
